    "description": "Starts Corporation Inc. engages in construction, real estate brokerage, real estate management, condominium development, publishing, hotel and leisure, elderly support and childcare, financial consulting, and retail and cultural businesses in Japan and internationally. The company provides construction, renovation, landscaping, property management, rental and sales brokerage, corporate housing management, rental housing guarantee, comprehensive building management, cleaning, elevator management, shopping center management, trust, insurance, asset management, and PFI consulting services. It also develops and sells residential and condominium properties; operates hotels, Japanese inns, golf courses, travel services, restaurants, nursing homes, elderly housing facilities, childcare facilities, and licensed nursery schools; and provides residential security systems and residential equipment products. In addition, the company operates OZmall, publishes OZ Magazine, Metro Minutes, books, e-books, comics, and Starts Publishing Bunko publications, and provides advertising agency, website and information system development, temporary staffing, and cultural facility management services. Starts Corporation Inc. was founded in 1969 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan."
